    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 3,
    "summary": "The altar is rebuilt—Regular sacrifices are reinstituted—The foundations of the temple are laid amid great rejoicing.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And when the seventh month was come, and the children of Israel were in the cities, the people gathered themselves together as one man to Jerusalem.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
